le_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1220510003":{"text":"あぁ、きっと一番頑丈なあの子ブタだね！どうりでいないと思った！","source_cn":"哦，你说的肯定是最健硕的那只小猪！我说怎么没看见它呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51779B16C720A833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220510006:2":{"text":"そんなの簡単だよ！昔、旦那と息子が子ブタたちのしつけに使ってた鈴があるんだ。","source_cn":"这事好办！我家有个铃铛，是以前我丈夫和儿子拿来训练小猪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAEA208B3AB84B1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220510007:1":{"text":"でも……はぁ、あの人たちがいなくなってもう何年も経つからね。昔飼ってたあのブタたちも、残ったのはあの子だけさ。ほかの子ブタたちは後から飼い始めたんだ。","source_cn":"不过……唉，他们都离开好多年了。当时养的那些猪，也只剩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2D50C8BCAE4D163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220510008:1":{"text":"もう長いこと使ってないから、どの小包に入ってたか忘れちゃったよ。探すのは簡単じゃなさそうだね。","source_cn":"那铃铛很久不用，我都忘记收到哪个包裹里了。现在想找出来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0F9EC52F1200AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220510009:1":{"text":"もしよければ、一緒に探してくれないかい？","source_cn":"你们要是不介意，就帮我一起找一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x789EFE22CD6FCE5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"……あれで子ブタなのか？","source_cn":"……那还算是小猪吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1240C52D49799CAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"……あれで子ブタなのか？","female":"……あれで子ブタなの？","variant_male_record_index":"66282","variant_female_record_index":"66283","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220510004:0":{"text":"呼び慣れちゃっただけだよ。旦那が最初に飼ってた子ブタたちの中で、残ったのはあの子だけさ。","source_cn":"叫习惯了而已。当年我丈夫养的第一批小猪里，就只剩下这一只了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBFF8D6FD4D7D4642","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"呼び慣れちゃっただけだよ。旦那が最初に飼ってた子ブタたちの中で、残ったのはあの子だけさ。","female":"呼び慣れちゃっただけだよ。旦那が最初に飼ってた子ブタたちの中で、残ったのはあの子だけさ。","variant_male_record_index":"134374","variant_female_record_index":"134375","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220510005:0":{"text":"だからほかのブタたちより体が大きいんですね。あの子をなだめる方法はありますか？","source_cn":"难怪它的体型比其他小猪都要大呢。那有没有什么可以驯服它...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35D251CB22E1322D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"あのブタをなだめる方法はあるのか？","source_cn":"你有办法安抚它吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0632D7C932FEC2DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"あのブタをなだめる方法はあるのか？","female":"あのブタをなだめる方法はあるかしら？","variant_male_record_index":"66284","variant_female_record_index":"66285","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:提塔尼娅":{"text":"ティ