……！","source_cn":"太好了，我们快点送他回去吧！满满实在不想被它继续瞪着了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9E8549F5A9E3FCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/ep2/quest_story/12205130.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12205130","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12205130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1220513001:1":{"text":"おばさん、どうして村の入り口に？","source_cn":"大婶，你怎么跑到村口来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C4C8B728FC41ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220513002:1":{"text":"このブタは頑固だからね！ちょうど村も少しは落ち着いたし、アンタたちを迎えに来たんだよ。","source_cn":"还不是因为这只猪脾气最倔！正好村里也安稳点了，我就想着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B57F4F9975FF36D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220513003:1":{"text":"本当にありがとうね！これでやっと安心して休めるよ。","source_cn":"多谢你们帮我找回它！现在我总算能安心歇一会儿了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB395822808266040","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220513004:1":{"text":"あっ、鈴をお返ししますね！","source_cn":"啊，别忘记收好这个！你的铃铛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A1631AA3E05D07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220513005:1":{"text":"あぁ……心配せずともちゃんとしまっておくよ。だって、これは旦那と息子が残していったものでもあるんだから……","source_cn":"哎……不用担心，我会好好收着它的。不管怎么说，也是我丈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6870A87FF40162CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1220513005":{"text":"あぁ……心配せずともちゃんとしまっておくよ。だって、これは旦那と息子が残していったものでもあるんだから……","source_cn":"哎……不用担心，我会好好收着它的。不管怎么说，也是我丈夫和儿子留下来的遗物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6870A87FF40162CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220513006:1":{"text":"……もう何年も前のことだから、平気だよ。","source_cn":"……都过去多少年了，我早就没事了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE08459620F8E6B70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……もう何年も前のことだから、平気だよ。","female":"……もう何年も前のことだから、平気だよ。","variant_male_record_index":"134390","variant_female_record_index":"134391","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220513007:1":{"text":"それにアタシたちみたいな海の近くに住んでる人間は、こういう日が来ることを分かってるからね。","source_cn":"再说了，我们这种靠海吃饭的人，早就知道会有这么一天。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB72932EEF6B0BAC4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"それにアタシたちみたいな海の近くに住んでる人間は、こういう日が来ることを分かってるからね。","female":"それにアタシたちみたいな海の近くに住んでる人間は、こういう日が来ることを分かってるからね。","variant_male_record_index":"134392","variant_female_record_index":"134393","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220513009:1":{"text":"ごめんなさい、悲しませるつもりじゃなかったんです……","source_cn":"抱歉，我们不是故意惹你伤心的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3D732CE7500DAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220513010:1":{"text":"ご、ごめんなさい！ロンロンも、この鈴がそんなに大事なものだって知らなくて……","source_cn":"对、对不起！满满也不知道，这个铃铛对你这么重要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB785A67828FD5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220513011:1":{"text":"いいんだよ、踏み込まないでおくれ！とっくに現実は受け入れてるんだ！","source_cn":"行了，别往心里去！我早就接受现实了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC937BB1AEA474516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220513012:1":{"text":"だけど、たまに、ごくたまに……二人が恋しくなるよ。","source_cn":"只不过，偶尔，很偶尔的时候……我还是会想他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6D009CF2B8A517C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"どうか気を落さずに……","source_cn":"节哀","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5510FE2CC752FCD0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"どうか気を落さずに……","female":"どうか気を落さずに……","variant_male_record_index":"66286","variant_female_record_index":"66287","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","documen